---
import LegalPageLayout from "@/layouts/LegalPageLayout.astro";
import { useTranslations } from "@/i18n/utils";

const t = useTranslations("en");
const title = t("legal.privacy.title");
const description = "Cloud Native Days France privacy policy. No cookies, self-hosted analytics.";
const lastUpdated = "2026-08-13";
---
<LegalPageLayout title={title} description={description} lastUpdated={lastUpdated} lang="en">
  <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mt-4">
    <strong>This site sets no cookies and retains no data that directly identifies you.</strong>
    It is a static site hosted on Cloud Native France's infrastructure.
    The audience measurement described below is self-hosted and cookie-free.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8">Audience measurement</h2>
  <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mt-4">
    We use <a href="https://umami.is" class="text-primary hover:underline">Umami</a>, an
    open-source analytics tool that we <strong>host ourselves</strong> on our own infrastructure.
    No data is sent to any third party.
  </p>
  <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mt-4">
    Umami works <strong>without cookies</strong>. For each visit, the following are recorded:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-4 space-y-2">
    <li>the page viewed and the time it was viewed;</li>
    <li>the referring site (for example, the social network you arrived from);</li>
    <li>the country, derived from your IP address;</li>
    <li>the browser, operating system, device type, screen size and language.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mt-4">
    <strong>Your IP address is not retained.</strong> It is used only at the time of the visit, to
    derive the country and to compute an anonymous session identifier; it is never written to any
    database. No advertising identifiers, no profiling, no sharing with third parties.
  </p>
  <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mt-4">
    Your browser's "Do Not Track" signal is honoured — if it is enabled, no visit is recorded.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8">Data Controller</h2>
  <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mt-4">
    Cloud Native France, a French loi 1901 non-profit association.<br />
    Address: 84, rue Pierre Sémard, 91700 Sainte-Geneviève-des-Bois, France.<br />
    Contact: <a href="mailto:contact@cloudnativedays.fr" class="text-primary hover:underline">contact@cloudnativedays.fr</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8">Third-party services</h2>
  <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mt-4">
    This site embeds a few third-party services that may set their own cookies or collect data under their own terms:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-4 space-y-2">
    <li>
      <strong>Google Fonts</strong> (DM Sans) — the font is served via the Astro Font integration.
      Policy: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-primary hover:underline">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>YouTube (youtube-nocookie.com)</strong> — the cookie-free variant used to embed the retrospective video on the Venue page.
      Policy: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-primary hover:underline">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>OpenStreetMap</strong> — venue map embedded via iframe.
      Policy: <a href="https://osmfoundation.org/wiki/Privacy_Policy" class="text-primary hover:underline">https://osmfoundation.org/wiki/Privacy_Policy</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Google Sheets (build-time fetch)</strong> — sponsor, team and schedule lists are fetched from Google Sheets when the site is compiled. No user data is transmitted to Google during your visit.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8">Your rights</h2>
  <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mt-4">
    Under the GDPR and the French "Informatique et Libertés" law, you have rights of access, rectification, erasure, restriction and objection regarding your personal data. Our audience measurement retains neither your IP address nor any identifier that could recognise you, so no recorded data can be linked back to you individually. You may nonetheless send any request or complaint to the contact address above, or directly to the French data-protection authority, the <a href="https://www.cnil.fr/en/home" class="text-primary hover:underline">CNIL</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8">Changes</h2>
  <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mt-4">
    This policy may be updated. The last-updated date is indicated at the top of this page.
  </p>
</LegalPageLayout>
